[size=5]Ragdoll Gravity Helper[/size]

A dummy dum dum mod that tries to make CP77's ragdolls fall a bit better. Pair with [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/cyberpunk2077/mods/3858]Ragdoll Physics Overhaul[/url].

That's it. That's the whole mod.

[color=#f1c232][size=4]Features[/size][/color]
[list]
[*]Ragdolls fall at a believable rate instead of being all floaty and weird.
[*]Two settings: enabled, and how strong the extra pull is
[/list]

[color=#f1c232][size=4]Requirements[/size][/color]
[list]
[*]RED4ext
[*]RedScript
[*]Mod Settings
[*]Redscript Configuration Framework if you want fancy mod menus
[/list]
